{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"Haskell"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"“Haskell”"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>Haskell 是一种"},{"Local":{"url":"函数式编程","text":"函数式编程"}},{"Plain":"语言.</p>\n<h2>下载与配置</h2>\n<p>下载\nhttps://www.haskell.org/downloads/</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p><code>:t (2+)  </code>(2+) :: Num a =&gt; a -&gt; a</p>\n<p><code>take 5 [1,4..]  </code>[1,4,7,10,13]</p>\n<p><code>f x y = x + y  </code>:t f\n`f :: Num a =&gt; a -&gt; a -&gt; a</p>\n<p><code>f x = x &lt; 3  </code>:t f\n`f :: (Ord a, Num a) =&gt; a -&gt; Bool</p>\n<p><code>g = (&lt;3)  </code>:t g\n`g :: (Ord a, Num a) =&gt; a -&gt; Bool</p>\n<p><code>f x y = (x == y)  </code>:t f\n`f :: Eq a =&gt; a -&gt; a -&gt; Bool</p>\n"}]}}